  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 3rd level, an etherknight can heal wounds (her own or those of others) by touch. Each use of this ability costs 2 FP. With one use of this ability, an etherknight can heal 1d6+1 hit points of damage for every two etherknight levels she possesses. Using this ability is a standard action, unless the etherknight targets herself, in which case it is a swift action. Despite the name of this ability, an etherknight only needs one free hand to use this ability. As an etherknight’s lay on hands is fueled by the ether and the ether does not subscribe to such silly concepts as the laws of physics, all creatures, be they living, undead, construct, or otherwise, are healed by an ether knight's lay on hands.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/etherknight#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
